{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into <strong>Pearls of Atlantis: Premium Edition</strong>, a beautiful physics-based puzzle game set in a magical underwater world! Match and pop pearls, unleash powerful combos, and uncover the secrets of Atlantis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No ads, no microtransactions, and all the fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980670/extras/74b42c7124c100c99f9136d293df3d3c.avif?t=1761930510\" width=620 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 1500 handcrafted levels, each level features unique, dynamic gameplay. Bumpers, rotating wheels, moving platforms, and gravity-bending obstacles turn every puzzle into a fresh challenge. Strategize your shots to trigger chain reactions, and master tricky layouts!\u00a0Once you've beaten a chapter, dive back in to earn a better score with endless<strong>\u00a0</strong>replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980670/extras/8c7718f3f3d5e0f49e9e55df53a2022b.avif?t=1761930510\" width=620 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash the magic of Atlantis with awesome powerups designed to turn the tide in your favor. From jellyfish to pearl-bursting bombs, use all types of powerups to create chain reactions, cool combos, and earn tons of points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980670/extras/b231c94abb1f066b213645fd1984f3bc.avif?t=1761930510\" width=620 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the charming mermaid Kaia and nautilus sidekick Nauty as they restore the once-glorious Cove of Memories. After an unfortunate submarine accident with an enthusiastic topsider named Andy, the magical sanctuary has been left in ruins. They'll need your help to unleash the power of pearls, solve puzzles, and customize Atlantis your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980670/extras/966b7d02ac2763cb53f5677deda21717.avif?t=1761930510\" width=620 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock decorations and upgrades to rebuild and personalize the Cove of Memories. Create your own peaceful retreat beneath the waves with coral gardens, vibrant fish, sunken statues, and whimsical sea sculptures. The treasure is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re a fan of classic match-3 puzzlers with a twist, you\u2019ll find hours of fun waiting in Pearls of Atlantis: Premium Edition. Perfect for quick sessions or long, cozy playthroughs, this is your chance to relax, restore, and explore\u2014 one pearl at a time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full game + no ads, microtransactions, or timers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1500+ fun and challenging levels  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique physics-based gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use powerups and boosters to blast through tough challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Kaia the Mermaid and her friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize the Cove of Memories, decorate your Gallery, and unlock special rewards</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3980670?t=1761930510","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980670/40ca54cebac5246dd2b1b576287511ca93c87372/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761930510","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980670/4e0752a81edd5920a9898dbbf9e2dd29130d948d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761930510","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980670/4e0752a81edd5920a9898dbbf9e2dd29130d948d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761930510","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into <strong>Pearls of Atlantis: Premium Edition</strong>, a beautiful physics-based puzzle game set in a magical underwater world! Match and pop pearls, unleash powerful combos, and uncover the secrets of Atlantis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No ads, no microtransactions, and all the fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980670/extras/74b42c7124c100c99f9136d293df3d3c.avif?t=1761930510\" width=620 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 1500 handcrafted levels, each level features unique, dynamic gameplay. Bumpers, rotating wheels, moving platforms, and gravity-bending obstacles turn every puzzle into a fresh challenge. Strategize your shots to trigger chain reactions, and master tricky layouts!\u00a0Once you've beaten a chapter, dive back in to earn a better score with endless<strong>\u00a0</strong>replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980670/extras/8c7718f3f3d5e0f49e9e55df53a2022b.avif?t=1761930510\" width=620 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash the magic of Atlantis with awesome powerups designed to turn the tide in your favor. From jellyfish to pearl-bursting bombs, use all types of powerups to create chain reactions, cool combos, and earn tons of points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980670/extras/b231c94abb1f066b213645fd1984f3bc.avif?t=1761930510\" width=620 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the charming mermaid Kaia and nautilus sidekick Nauty as they restore the once-glorious Cove of Memories. After an unfortunate submarine accident with an enthusiastic topsider named Andy, the magical sanctuary has been left in ruins. They'll need your help to unleash the power of pearls, solve puzzles, and customize Atlantis your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980670/extras/966b7d02ac2763cb53f5677deda21717.avif?t=1761930510\" width=620 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock decorations and upgrades to rebuild and personalize the Cove of Memories. Create your own peaceful retreat beneath the waves with coral gardens, vibrant fish, sunken statues, and whimsical sea sculptures. The treasure is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re a fan of classic match-3 puzzlers with a twist, you\u2019ll find hours of fun waiting in Pearls of Atlantis: Premium Edition. Perfect for quick sessions or long, cozy playthroughs, this is your chance to relax, restore, and explore\u2014 one pearl at a time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full game + no ads, microtransactions, or timers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1500+ fun and challenging levels  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique physics-based gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use powerups and boosters to blast through tough challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Kaia the Mermaid and her friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize the Cove of Memories, decorate your Gallery, and unlock special rewards</p></li></ul>","developers":["Alder Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2678160","name":"Pearls of Atlantis: The Cove"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980670/ca36efaf808e45884641b47447c8b6e6343f29f5/header.jpg?t=1761930510","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3980670/1227968542/537f70b56465df06b1f1be9ccf899fb7d975b1fe/1756164049/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761583442","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3980670/1227968542/537f70b56465df06b1f1be9ccf899fb7d975b1fe/1756164049/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761583442","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3980670/1227968542/537f70b56465df06b1f1be9ccf899fb7d975b1fe/1756164049/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761583442","id":257188851,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257188851/movie480.mp4?t=1761583442","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257188851/movie_max.mp4?t=1761583442"},"name":"Pearls of Atlantis: Premium Edition Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257188851/603f90e15643a09f0ec24c5a8693706bbeaa287f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761583442","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257188851/movie480.webm?t=1761583442","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/25718885